{"type":"step_start","timestamp":1794344460424,"sessionID":"ses_e38db2bd8ffePAik0ne8IijSVn","part":{"id":"prt_1c743a044001AbkolJ41NRqWxx","messageID":"msg_1c742b189001Kxmi6Bwe0sQjAf","sessionID":"ses_e38db2bd8ffePAik0ne8IijSVn","type":"step-start"}}
{"type":"text","timestamp":1794344460425,"sessionID":"ses_e38db2bd8ffePAik0ne8IijSVn","part":{"id":"prt_1c743a063001lJMX4odeBwpNT2","messageID":"msg_1c742b189001Kxmi6Bwe0sQjAf","sessionID":"ses_e38db2bd8ffePAik0ne8IijSVn","type":"text","text":"## Objective\n- Build a private team customer directory: Flask JSON API under `/api` (auth, customers CRUD, interactions) plus a React/TypeScript/Vite + Tailwind frontend, served by the backend on port 8000, data in SQLite under `./data`, all built from the workspace root `Dockerfile`.\n\n## Important Details\n- Workspace: `/workspace` (base commit `0054c90`), entry `backend/app.py`, deps `backend/requirements.txt` + `backend/requirements.lock` (constraints), frontend in `frontend/` (`npm run build` → `frontend/dist`), image runs `gunicorn --bind 0.0.0.0:8000 --pythonpath backend app:app`.\n- Sandbox: Python 3.13.5, Node 24, npm registry + pip registry reachable; no browser available (Playwright blocked: missing `libatomic.so.1`, no root, CDN returns 403 via gateway) → UI verified only by build/typecheck/code review.\n- `/tmp/opencode/*` file creation is denied → scratch work in `/workspace/.scratch/` and `/workspace/.venv/` (must be cleaned up at end).\n- Error response convention decided: field validation → `{\"error\": \"<msg or 'Validation failed.'>\", \"errors\": {field: msg}}` (400); non-field errors → `{\"error\": \"<msg>\"}`. Duplicate email message: `\"Duplicate email: a customer with this email already exists.\"` (400, on `email`).\n- Key API decisions: login returns exactly `{\"token\": ...}`; register → 201 `{\"message\": \"Account created.\"}`; DELETE customer → 204; page/page_size defaults 1/10 (must be ≥1 ints, else 400); company filter = case-insensitive exact match; `q` searches name/email/company/phone/notes (LIKE with `\\` escaping); extra endpoint `GET /api/companies` → `{\"items\": [...]}` for the frontend filter dropdown; interaction kinds restricted to `call|email|meeting`; timestamps `YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SS[.mmm]Z`; interaction `logged_by` stores username; customer/interaction/list response shapes contain exactly the keys in the spec.\n- Frontend decisions: no router lib (pushState + popstate in `src/App.tsx`, `navigate()` exported); token/username in localStorage; register auto-logs in; `build` script = `tsc --noEmit && vite build`; Tailwind v4 via `@tailwindcss/vite` plugin and `src/index.css` = `@import \"tailwindcss\";`.\n- Auth header parsing accepts `Bearer` case-insensitively; 401 (non-auth endpoints) triggers `setUnauthorizedHandler` → clears session → sign-in screen.\n- pip note: system pip 25.1.1 fails `pip install -r backend/requirements.txt -c backend/requirements.lock` with \"In --require-hashes mode, all requirements must be pinned with ==\"; a fresh venv with pip 26.3 runs the exact same command successfully → lock file is fine, Docker (recent pip) unaffected.\n\n## Work State\n### Completed\n- Backend `backend/app.py` written: SQLite (`data/directory.db`, WAL, FK cascade), pbkdf2/scrypt via `werkzeug.security`, token table, all endpoints (auth register/login, customers list/create/get/put/delete, interactions list/create, companies, health, `/api/<path>` catch-all 404, 405/404 JSON handlers, SPA fallback).\n- Backend verified via `/workspace/.scratch/apitest.py` (Flask test client) and live gunicorn on `127.0.0.1:8010`: all flows pass (401 without token, 201 register, token login, dup email 400, paging/search/company filter, PUT clears omitted optionals, 204 delete + cascade, interactions newest-first, unknown `/api` → 404 JSON).\n- `backend/requirements.txt` updated to add `werkzeug==3.1.9` (already present in lock); verified install with pip 26.3 + constraints succeeds.\n- Frontend scaffolded: `tsconfig.json` (strict), `vite.config.ts` (+`tailwindcss()` plugin), `src/index.css`, `src/vite-env.d.ts` (fixes TS7 error TS2882 for CSS side-effect import), `index.html` title → \"Customer Directory\", `package.json` pinned exact deps + scripts `build`/`typecheck`.\n- Frontend sources written: `src/api.ts` (fetch wrapper, `ApiError` with `fieldErrors`, session helpers), `src/types.ts`, `src/format.ts`, `src/main.tsx`, `src/App.tsx`, `src/components/AuthScreen.tsx`, `CustomerList.tsx`, `CustomerForm.tsx`, `CustomerDetail.tsx`.\n- Fixed list-refresh bug after creating a customer (`refreshKey` state added to fetch deps; `createCustomer` resets filters and calls `refreshCompanies()`).\n- `npm ci` (clean) + `npm run build` (tsc + vite) pass; dist assets served correctly by gunicorn (`/`, SPA route, CSS/JS all 200).\n\n### Active\n- Final verification/round-off: backend API re-test after last edits, then cleanup.\n\n### Blocked\n- (none)\n\n## Next Move\n1. Re-run `/workspace/.scratch/apitest.py` (with `DATA_DIR` scratch) and one more `npm run typecheck && npm run build` to confirm everything still passes after the `refreshKey` edit and requirements change.\n2. Kill the background gunicorn on port 8010, delete `/workspace/.scratch` and `/workspace/.venv`, and do a final review pass over the spec checklist (endpoints, response shapes, frontend screens) before finishing.\n\n## Relevant Files\n- `/workspace/backend/app.py`: full Flask API + frontend hosting (main deliverable).\n- `/workspace/backend/requirements.txt`: now `flask==3.1.3`, `gunicorn==26.2.0`, `werkzeug==3.1.9`.\n- `/workspace/backend/requirements.lock`: pinned constraints with hashes (verified working with pip 26.3).\n- `/workspace/Dockerfile`: unchanged build contract (port 8000, `/api`, `./data`).\n- `/workspace/frontend/package.json`: exact-pinned deps, `build` = `tsc --noEmit && vite build`.\n- `/workspace/frontend/tsconfig.json`, `src/vite-env.d.ts`: TS7 strict config + vite client types.\n- `/workspace/frontend/vite.config.ts`: react + tailwindcss plugins.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/api.ts`, `src/App.tsx`, `src/format.ts`, `src/types.ts`: API layer, routing/header, date helpers.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/components/`: `AuthScreen.tsx`, `CustomerList.tsx`, `CustomerForm.tsx`, `CustomerDetail.tsx`.\n- `/workspace/.scratch/apitest.py`: backend test script (delete when done).\n- `/workspace/.venv/`: local test venv (delete when done).","time":{"start":1794344460387,"end":1794344460391}}}
