{"type":"text","timestamp":1794344608643,"sessionID":"ses_e38db2bd8ffePAik0ne8IijSVn","part":{"id":"prt_1c745e365001si9tC218eC454n","messageID":"msg_1c7457dba001h7Aqx3OuTZ7ILQ","sessionID":"ses_e38db2bd8ffePAik0ne8IijSVn","type":"text","text":"Done — everything's verified and cleaned up. Summary of the work:\n\n**Backend** (`backend/app.py`)\n- Full Flask JSON API under `/api`: register/login (returns `{token}` only), customers CRUD (paged list with `q`/`company` filters, PUT clears omitted optionals, DELETE cascades interactions), interactions (newest-first, kinds limited to call/email/meeting), `/api/companies`, `/api/health`\n- Errors: field → `{\"error\", \"errors\"}`; duplicate email → 400 with `\"Duplicate email: ...\"`; JSON 404/405 catch-alls + SPA fallback\n- SQLite under `./data`; serves `frontend/dist` on port 8000\n\n**Dependencies**\n- `requirements.txt`: flask 3.1.3, gunicorn 26.2.0, werkzeug 3.1.9\n- `requirements.lock`: kept exact pins but dropped hash lines — hashes inside a constraints file put old pip (≤26.0) in require-hashes mode and the documented install command failed; verified the exact Dockerfile command now works on pip 25.1.1 and 26.3\n\n**Frontend** (React + TS + Vite + Tailwind v4)\n- Sign-in/register screen, customer list (debounced search, company filter, pagination, add modal), customer detail (inline edit, delete, interaction log + form), pushState routing, localStorage session, 401 → sign-out\n- `npm run build` = `tsc --noEmit && vite build` (passes)\n\n**Verification**\n- Full API test suite passes (auth, validation, paging, search, cascade delete, unknown-route JSON 404s)\n- Live gunicorn smoke test: health, SPA, and built assets served correctly\n- UI verified by typecheck/build/code review only — no browser available in this sandbox\n\n**Cleanup**: test scratch dirs, venv, `__pycache__` removed; test server stopped.","time":{"start":1794344608613,"end":1794344608617}}}
